{"id":"blue-paw-prints","title":"The Blue Paw Prints","level":4,"series":"Dash Adventures","cover":{"h":"556642c8ca32e1d4a812fa490b5c1290","t":"image/webp"},"titleAudio":null,"cast":[{"role":"hero","name":"Logan","portrait":{"h":"cf541143e9c73f6a4921ebd5175623cb","t":"image/webp"}},{"role":"sister","name":"Anastasia","portrait":{"h":"4b8a1a7bc845473e95a93b7d3c7d3a7d","t":"image/webp"}},{"role":"dad","name":"Dad","portrait":{"h":"4a3effd5da379d9c095d2ece4f986c49","t":"image/webp"}},{"role":"mum","name":"Mum","portrait":{"h":"4e8d5c2035e2129d567a2a2bbf62e944","t":"image/webp"}},{"role":"dash","name":"Dash","portrait":{"h":"5394e0f1443cd76f83368aaf141c3340","t":"image/webp"}}],"mystery":null,"practise":["blue","clue","paw","first","shirt","twirl","joy"],"common":["was","come","one","they","he","full"],"challenge":["birthday","dinosaur"],"before":"What does a detective do? What clues might they look for?","after":["What was the first clue?","Why did Dad have jam on his shirt?","Why did Dad and Dash take the buns?","Who do you think ate the missing bun?"],"retell":[2,4,6,8,10,13],"pages":[{"text":"It is Mum's birthday!","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"9041600dcc1b64e3129e3a019a418bf1","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"A bright kitchen in the morning with balloons and a banner.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"But the stack of jam buns is not on the dish!","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"98cba4dc8701852450451bd7d97b9699","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"An empty cake stand with only crumbs and a smear of jam.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"Logan gets a big lens.","bubble":{"who":"sister","name":"Anastasia","text":"Let's look for clues!","side":"left"},"image":{"h":"5e5e6f523ff50cf6a51cde233604ee23","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Logan holds a big magnifying glass; Anastasia wears a detective hat and holds a notepad.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"The first clue is a blue paw print.","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"c352dcd9a0d6a8098e8e44bd715bae22","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Close-up through the magnifying glass: a small bright-blue three-toed paw print on the kitchen floor tiles.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"Then they spot a trail of blue paw prints.","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"2b9cc61a8305114c06bed654b4058fc7","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"A trail of blue paw prints leads across the kitchen floor and out into the hall.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"The trail leads up the stairs.","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"fc95f9d81effc19bc29b315831a9cf36","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Blue paw prints go up the carpeted stairs.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"The next clue is a bit of bun.","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"6b93bc62f75e0a48323dafbeb1a0048f","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Close-up: a crumb of bun with a blob of jam on a stair, seen through the magnifying glass.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"Dad is on the landing. He has jam on his shirt!","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"56f5933877f5cf6ffe839b7c7e6c26e4","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Dad stands at the top of the stairs trying to look innocent, hands behind his back, with a big jam smear on his shirt and a crumb on his chin.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"Logan looks at Dad.","bubble":{"who":"hero","name":"Logan","text":"Was it you, Dad?","side":"left"},"image":{"h":"e9df629c39dc9c6f3f97c6b062b285b5","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Logan points the magnifying glass at Dad's jammy shirt.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"Dad grins.","bubble":{"who":"dad","name":"Dad","text":"It was me... and Dash!","side":"right"},"image":{"h":"c231e3e9450a10af3ca967556ae084c8","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Dad grins sheepishly as Dash pops out from behind him with bright blue paws and blue icing on his nose.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"Dash has blue paws and a big blue grin.","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"b74a965a5b688d7f50507e46c0f9f193","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Close-up of Dash holding up his bright blue paws and beaming.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"Dad and Dash had a plan. Come and see!","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"d28b7e5558ada92be5f7f7f10e0422d2","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Dad and Dash lead the family down the garden path (a cosy British terraced house with a small back garden, a lawn and a wooden shed).","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"It is a big bun dinosaur with a blue twirl on top!","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"247e84ff3aad4043da8c4e2f0eeedd15","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"On the garden table: a dinosaur built out of jam buns, covered in swirls of blue icing, with birthday candles on its back.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"Mum is full of joy.","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"885ea0b0112e7903b5b5a31ad90366db","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Mum hugs Dad, Logan and Anastasia.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}},{"text":"But one bun is missing... and Dash is licking his lips!","bubble":null,"image":{"h":"207f4fbcdbbb24ba7cc20cfab772f4f2","t":"image/webp"},"alt":"Close-up of the bun dinosaur with one obvious gap.","audio":{"text":null,"bubble":null}}],"words":{}}